# Supabase migrations

## File naming

New migrations: `supabase/migrations/YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_description.sql`

Apply via Supabase CLI (`supabase db push`) or dashboard SQL editor. Update the relevant `docs/modules/*.md` changelog.

## Tenancy

- Every tenant table includes `organization_id uuid not null references organizations(id)`
- RLS enabled on all tenant tables
- Standard policy pattern:

```sql
create policy "members can access org data"
  on public.my_table for all
  using (
    organization_id in (
      select organization_id from organization_members
      where user_id = (select auth.uid())
    )
  );
```

## Auth triggers

- Profile + default org created on signup via `on_auth_user_created` trigger (see foundation migration)
- Never store service-role keys in frontend env vars

## Storage (Phase 3+)

- Bucket per org or path prefix: `{organization_id}/{candidate_slug}/`
- Storage policies mirror Postgres RLS membership checks
